&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2139&quot; data-local-id=&quot;16b36f473227&quot;&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in B2B SaaS Product Management or a related technical leadership role focused on developer platforms, infrastructure, or SDLC tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2308&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0a0acecd5a7a&quot;&gt;You have experience defining, instrumenting, and operationalizing engineering performance and reliability metrics, including DORA metrics and deployment health indicators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2482&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b562d5c938a6&quot;&gt;You are comfortable navigating ambiguity and influencing highly technical stakeholders, including senior engineers and technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2625&quot; data-local-id=&quot;788e4b863c63&quot;&gt;You have a strong perspective on how AI is transforming software engineering workflows and understand the operational, reliability, and governance risks introduced by autonomous systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2814&quot; data-local-id=&quot;45e4174d0624&quot;&gt;You are an effective communicator who can present complex technical concepts to engineering teams, cross-functional stakeholders, and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d38f74f6f1be&quot;&gt;You have a Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Information Technology, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
