&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1580&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cb7e2693bece&quot;&gt;Drive the company&#39;s most technically complex and consequential bets through cross-functional agreement, organizational visibility, and influence&lt;/p&gt;
