&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1886&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73f211665281&quot;&gt;Own large cross-functional programs spanning multiple engineering orgs, product, and business functions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
