&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1396&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c8df5783f61&quot;&gt;Work closely with engineers and designers to deliver new product capabilities end-to-end, from early concept through launch and iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
